1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,660
Kita tengah solat, kemudian

2
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:08,740
kita rukuk, rukuk, bagi orang lain,

3
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:11,600
dia, bagi orang yang dia kena

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,320
buat ialah takbiratul ihram, Allahu

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:18,174
Akbar, kemudian rukuk, tinggalkanlah

6
00:00:18,239 --> 00:00:20,250
Fatihah itu, maka dia dipanggil

7
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:23,800
