34
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:26,220
Tak kena lagi.

35
00:01:26,220 --> 00:01:28,417
Jadi yang penting lah, Allahu Akbar

36
00:01:28,417 --> 00:01:31,530
sekali dulu, rukun pertama, rukun

37
00:01:31,530 --> 00:01:34,220
ihram, kemudian barulah pergi kepada

38
00:01:34,220 --> 00:01:36,420
rukun seterusnya, Allahu

39
00:01:36,810 --> 00:01:38,010
Akbar.
